DESCRIPTION:Hoping to reconcile with his girlfriend Lyn (Anne Bancroft in 
 her screen debut)\, pilot Jed Towers (Richard Widmark) arrives at the hote
 l where she works only to be rebuffed. Meanwhile\, a fragile young woman n
 amed Nell Forbes (Marilyn Monroe) is trying to get a fresh start in life a
 fter being in a sanitarium by babysitting for one of the hotel’s familie
