DESCRIPTION:Join us Sunday\, November 1 from 2-4 p.m. in the St. Mark’s 
 parking lot for an afternoon of Halloween fun. Dress up\, bring your frien
 ds\, and enjoy trunks full of candy\, games\, and fall fun for all ages! W
 e will also have hot chocolate for all to enjoy. We request all Trunk-or-T
 reaters AND Trunk Hosts register on SignUpGenius (listed here as the event
  website) in advance. \nWe are also collecting nut-free candy and small to
 ys to make sure every child leaves with a smile. Donations can be dropped 
