 vent will take place at several indoor spaces across campus\, including IU
  Auditorium\, Eskenazi Museum of Art\, Grunwald Gallery\, Lilly Library\, 
 Wells Library\, Wylie House Museum\, McCalla\, and Ford-Crawford Hall. Eac
 h space will host its own lineup of activities and offer special giveaways
