BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Mad Bills to Pay w/ Q&A | New Americas Cinema
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261106T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261106T211500
UID:e21ea5dc7f852dcaa27201bff991b20b@visitbloomington.com
DESCRIPTION:In a tight-knit Dominican American community in The Bronx\, Ri
 co (Juan Collado) is hustling his way through the summer\, selling bootleg
  "nutcracker" cocktails out of a beach cooler and chasing girls without a 
 care in the world. But when his teenage girlfriend\, Destiny (Destiny Chec
 o)\, begins crashing at his place with his family\, turning their small ap
 artment into a stage for their messy\, complicated young love\, it’s onl
 y a matter of time before they’re hit with the sobering reality of growi
 ng up too fast in a city that waits for no one. Writer-director Joel Alfon
 so Vargas turns his hometown into the heartbeat of his debut feature\, tea
 ming up with street-cast talent Collado and Checo\, to deliver a raw and d
 eeply authentic look at life in The Bronx. [101 min\; comedy\, drama\; Eng
 lish and Spanish with English subtitles]\nA Q&A with filmmaker Joel Alfons
 o Vargas will follow the screening.
GEO:39.168585;-86.517361
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 E. 7th Street\, Bloomington\, IN 47405
URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/event/mad-bills-to-pay-w-qa-new-ameri
 cas-cinema/59993/
X-SOURCE:Visit Bloomington
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/events/
END:VEVENT
