DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261109T153000
UID:d8178e0d328be5f2d66ad5617a7b38ef@visitbloomington.com
DESCRIPTION:2026 has already proven to be one of the hottest years on reco
 rd\, but it has also seen a decline in news coverage of climate change nat
 ionwide. This panel will examine the dynamics that influence news attentio
 n to climate change and consider the challenges of reporting the beat in a
  contested political and economic environment for climate journalism.\nPan
 elists: \n• Ryan Comfort\, The Media School \n• Suzannah Evans Comfort
 \, The Media School \n• Karl Schneider\, IndyStar
