BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Wages of Fear | Re:Made
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261110T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261110T213000
UID:0fd58f1838767000fcfb55bde30d0da1@visitbloomington.com
DESCRIPTION:In a downtrodden South American oil town\, four desperate men 
 sign on for a suicide mission: driving trucks packed with nitroglycerin ov
 er makeshift roads and treacherous mountain terrain. The men are forced to
  navigate fires\, bumps\, and jolts\, while their fortitude and friendship
  are put to the ultimate test: keep cool or die. The Wages of Fear is\, ha
 nds down\, one of the greatest thrillers of all time and a white-knuckle r
 ide from Clouzot\, France’s legendary master of suspense. [152 min\; sus
 pense\, thriller\; French with English subtitles]
GEO:39.168585;-86.517361
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 E. 7th Street\, Bloomington\, IN 47405
URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/event/the-wages-of-fear-remade/59998/
