BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Raise the Red Lantern | The Long Revolution
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261112T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261112T211500
UID:96f21a16835f322e169dc2cab35f09b6@visitbloomington.com
DESCRIPTION:With her family thrown into despair by the death of her father
 \, teenager Songlian becomes the third concubine of wealthy Master Chen. S
 oon\, she discovers that behind her palatial luxury of life\, she and her 
 fellow concubines are pitted against each other in a struggle for his affe
 ctions. [125 min\; drama\; Mandarin with English subtitles]\nThe 4K restor
 ation of Raise the Red Lantern was carried out by the Udine Far East Film 
 Festival on the occasion of its 26th edition. The original image and sound
  negatives were used under the supervision of Director Zhang Yimou. The vi
 ntage positive copy\, presented at the 1991 Venice International Film Fest
 ival and preserved at the Venice Biennale's Historical Archive of Contempo
 rary Arts\, was used for color reference. The restoration was made in 2024
  at L'Immagine Ritrovata (Hong Kong - Bologna).
GEO:39.168585;-86.517361
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 E. 7th Street\, Bloomington\, IN 47405
URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/event/raise-the-red-lantern-the-long-
 revolution/59999/
X-SOURCE:Visit Bloomington
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/events/
END:VEVENT
