UID:fed802d70998e4466244ec7ad4ea1957@visitbloomington.com
DESCRIPTION:Whether you love written word or spoken word\, Storytelling at
  the Museum is the program for you! Join the IUMAA as we celebrate an age-
 old tradition.\nThis program has a little bit of everything for booklovers
  and storytellers!\nTake home a custom typewriter poem from the Bloomingto
 n Writer’s Guild or try your hand at typing one yourself!\nFeeling inspi
 red by poetry? Create a tiny keepsake with our picture frame poetry craft!
 \nMake a book nook to liven up your bookshelves and decorate a bookplate t
 o add to your favorite novel.\nInterested in the ancient art of writing an
 d storytelling? Make your own cuneiform tablet out of clay!\nSnack on some
  gourmet cookies and pies while getting your creativity flowing.\nThis pro
 gram is free and open to all\, with Museum galleries remaining open for th
 e entirety of the event to give a special\, after-hours view of the exhibi
 tions.
