UID:deb0752bec3e9ab546d43a6ecd5793ca@visitbloomington.com
DESCRIPTION:Go Beyond is a benefit dinner raising the final funds to send 
 blind Navy veteran Lonnie Bedwell to the North Pole\, the last leg of his 
 Explorers Grand Slam. Every ticket and sponsorship helps complete Beyond V
 ision\, the feature documentary chronicling his journey from losing his si
 ght in 1997 to conquering all seven summits. Join us for cocktails\, dinne
 r\, a filmmaker panel\, a silent auction\, and an exclusive first look at 
 scenes from the film\, all in celebration of a story that proves no summit
  is out of reach. Dress code: Business casual to cocktail attire. Come com
 fortable\, come dressed up\, just come ready to celebrate
