BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Manhunter: The Final Cut | Additional Films and Guests
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261116T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261116T210000
UID:483a841e3b0b579bef8d24527bf8fe8d@visitbloomington.com
DESCRIPTION:A retired criminal profiler (William Petersen) reluctantly ret
 urns to the FBI to help track down a serial killer of families and is forc
 ed to consult an expert: the imprisoned Dr. Hannibal Lecktor (Brian Cox in
  a subtly chilling performance). The third feature written and directed by
  Michael Mann is a gripping adaptation of the first of Thomas Harris' four
  novels featuring the iconic murderer Lecter (whose spelling was changed f
 or Mann's film)\, and benefits from the filmmaker's typically striking vis
 uals as well as a top-notch supporting cast\, including Tom Noonan as the 
 hunted killer and three-time Oscar nominee Joan Allen as his blind love in
 terest. This new 4K cut\, overseen by Mann\, enhances the film’s depth\,
  visual clarity and sound\, offering audiences the ultimate immersive vers
 ion that is both a restoration and a final edit. This 4K scan of the origi
 nal 35mm negative—with a few shots from an interpositive—was conformed
  and digitally restored at L’Immagine Ritrovata in Bologna\, strictly fo
 llowing the new reference edit done by Michael Mann. [122 min\; mystery\, 
 thriller\; English]
GEO:39.168585;-86.517361
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 E. 7th Street\, Bloomington\, IN 47405
URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/event/manhunter-the-final-cut-additio
 nal-films-and-guests/60005/
X-SOURCE:Visit Bloomington
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/events/
END:VEVENT
