UID:52ca5d70ddcaf82e29faa1f7676dae11@visitbloomington.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a conversation with Doug Jones\, one of the most v
 ersatile actors working today and the modern successor to classic screen i
 con Lon Chaney. The program will begin with an onstage conversation with J
 ones\, followed by a screening of Hellboy II: The Golden Army\, which feat
 ures an acclaimed performance by Jones as Abe Sapien. After the film\, Jon
 es will return to the stage for a post-film chat and take questions from t
 he audience. Note: your tickets to the conversation also includes viewing 
 the film.\nHellboy II: The Golden Army\, Guillermo del Toro's follow-up to
  his smash comic book adaptation\, once again finds our (anti) hero\, his 
 pyrokinetic girlfriend\, and aquatic empath (Doug Jones) facing their bigg
 est battle when an underworld prince plans to reclaim Earth for his magica
 l kindred. Only Hellboy and company can stop the dark prince and prevent h
 umanity's annihilation. [120 min\; action\, fantasy\; English]
GEO:39.168585;-86.517361
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 E. 7th Street\, Bloomington\, IN 47405
URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/event/in-conversation-doug-jones-hell
 boy-ii-the-golden-army-jorgensen-guest-filmmaker-series/60007/
