 .\nGlass has a secret double life: it cuts\, melts\, and moves in ways tha
 t seem almost magical (spoiler: it's all science). Get hands-on with activ
 ities for all ages — try your hand at glass fusing\, create a mosaic to 
 take home\, or discover the surprising\, sweet-toothed properties glass sh
 ares with sugar.
