UID:bbaee79e0e078894679d61816d4da7ae@visitbloomington.com
DESCRIPTION:CLOSED Nov. 28  \n The Bloomington Winter Farmers' Market is 
 the oldest winter market in Indiana. The Winter Market has a diversity of 
 vendors and products including fresh produce\, local meat and poultry\, da
 iry products\, eggs\, maple syrup\, honey products\, breads\, baked goods
 \, jams and sauces\, prepared foods\, locally roasted coffee\, cut flowers
 \, seeds and plants and many other items. You can find everything you need
  for nourishing winter meals along with local crafts. The Bloomington Wint
 er Farmers’ Market provides Monroe and surrounding counties with a farme
 rs’ market through winter.\n *Please check their website and social medi
 a pages for any closures around the holidays and a list of participating v
 endors each week.*
