BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:One Time Pottery Wheel Session
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20270108T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20270108T203000
UID:98bc4c340b2d2b4f7ffdb635d2f75a03@visitbloomington.com
DESCRIPTION:Open to all ages. Learn basic steps of centering and throwing 
 on the wheel. Class lasts 1 1/2 hours and includes instruction\, materials
  and use of tools for $50. Bisque and glaze firing is included for one pie
